# Volkswagen Golf Mk1 three-door hatchback, 1974-1983.
#
# 3,705 mm long, 1,610 mm wide, 1,395 mm high, 2,400 mm wheelbase; 1.1-1.8
# petrol and 1.5/1.6 diesel. Giugiaro's boxy hatch, the class benchmark.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Volkswagen_Golf_Mk1
#
# Colours: Mars Red, Alpine White, Diamond Silver and Black are period Golf
# colours.
#
# Weight: 280 in total (red 80, white 75, silver 65, black 60).
#
# Speed 150 km/h; comfort 90/465 (line). Classes 0,1.
# Dates: 1974-1983 with a road tail to about 1994.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/vw-golf-mk1.blend. References:
# citycars/references/vw-golf-mk1/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

